    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Development Site, Weavers Row, Clonsilla, Dublin 15 \r\nA highly attractive development opportunity located at Weavers Row, Clonsilla comprising of a regular shaped site extending to approximately 0.2 hectares (c.0.5 acres) with strong road frontage in an established and sought after residential/commercial setting.\r\nThe site is considered suitable for a variety of development options, subject to necessary planning permission, and benefits from its scale, configuration, and prominent frontage, all of which lend themselves to future redevelopment.\r\nAn existing two bedroomed cottage currently occupies the site, offering potential for interim use or incorporation into a wider development strategy, depending on planning requirements. \r\nThe location is particularly compelling from a development perspective. Situated close to a full range of local services and infrastructure, the property is within easy reach of schools, shops, Clonsilla Rail Station, and employment hubs. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, one of Ireland’s largest retail destinations, is just a short drive away. The N3/M50 and Dublin City Centre are all readily accessible. \r\nThis excellent opportunity for developers and investors to acquire a well located site in a mature residential area with proven demand and strong long term fundamentals."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Development Highlights \r\nApprox. 0.2 hectare (c 0.5 acre) site\r\nExcellent road frontage \r\nEstablished residential location \r\nExisting 2 bedroom cottage on site \r\nDevelopment potential (subject to planning permission)\r\nClose to transport links and amenities including Clonsilla Train Station \r\nEasy access to N3, M50 and Dublin City Centre"
      }
    ],
